Institutional Mandate - legal acts and other agreements European: 


 Regulation (EU) 2016/792 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 11 May 2016 on harmonised indices of consumer prices and the house price index;

 Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2023/1470 of 17 July 2023 laying down the methodological and technical specifications in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/792 of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards the house price index and the owner-occupied housing price index, and amending Commission Regulation (EU) 2020/1148. Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1182 of 17 June 2025 which establishes the rules on the rescaling of the HPI and OOHPI to the common index reference period of 2025.

